  "2026-10-24T10:12:07.197Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check clarification: the exact live version search also returned pm-quzx as a comment-only policy mention; it is the broad external-package dependency-range owner, not an ESLint implementation leaf. The full corpus and current active list contain no competing version-specific implementation owner. The parent queue remains open/unclaimed while this child carries the implemented version and verification."
  "2026-10-24T10:18:29.299Z","harness:codex","Verification: source typechecking and ESLint10.13.0 lint pass with the existing zero-warning policy. The full dependency advisory gate passes567 locked packages, and GitHub has no open security alerts. Initial full-source verification exposed only schema-read fixture expectations, a missing npm module path on this host, and the separate host command-census gap for the latest package; none is an ESLint rule waiver. Keep the parent cooldown queue open and unclaimed."
